lds</a>.</li>\n<li>As announced on September 01, 2020, the patch changed its XP from 31,200 to 23,400, and its loot was reduced by 10%.</li>\n<li>As announced on April 15, 2021, the patch changed its XP from 23,400 to 21,700.</li>\n<li>As announced on June 01, 2021, the patch changed its XP from 21,700 to 19,000.</li>\n<li>As announced on February 01, 2022, the patch changed its XP from 19,000 to 17,860, and its loot was reduced by 6%.</li>\n<li>As announced on April 04, 2023, the patch reduced its loot by 8%.</li>\n<li>As announced on July 18, 2023, the patch changed its XP from 17,860 to 17,324.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2,356 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.54</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"54.159593\" style=\"text-align:center;\">54%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Great Spirit Potion\" class=\"mw-file-ele